    7. Place the frame at a random valid position with margin >=1 on each side.
    8. Fill all cells outside the frame with random noise from the content palette (same colors as interior).
    9. Verify no accidental monochrome rectangle outside has larger interior area than the main frame; if so, re-randomize noise.
